title: products_lpr
---
// src: https://www.flocksafety.com/products/license-plate-readers and /faq
Cam: Solar-powered license plate readers capture accurate plates and vehicle details in any condition — up to 100 mph, day and night, and up to 75 feet away.
// src: https://www.flocksafety.com/products/license-plate-readers
Cam: They feed the nation's largest connected LPR network, which helps law enforcement, businesses, and communities share vehicle evidence securely. #newmessage
<<jump hub>>
===
title: products_video
---
// src: https://www.flocksafety.com/products/video-cameras
Cam: Fixed and PTZ cameras, AC or solar, monitor key areas and link footage with AI-powered analytics to accelerate investigations.
<<jump hub>>
===
title: products_trailers
---
// src: https://www.flocksafety.com/products/mobile-security-trailer
Cam: Mobile security trailers put video coverage where you need it most, with no power or Wi-Fi required — fully solar-powered, LTE-connected, and in most cases no permits needed.
<<jump hub>>
===
title: products_audio
---
// src: https://www.flocksafety.com/products/gunshot-detection
Cam: Audio detection finds critical sounds in real time, from gunfire to street takeovers or car accidents.
<<jump hub>>
===
title: products_dfr
---
// src: https://www.flocksafety.com/products/flock-dfr
Cam: An all-in-one, fully automated air support system: first eyes on scene, reaching calls in about 86 seconds.
// src: https://www.flocksafety.com/products/flock-dfr
Cam: Alpha reads license plates from up to 2,000 feet away, and one in five calls is resolved without dispatching patrol. #newmessage
<<jump hub>>
===
title: products_das
---
// src: https://www.flocksafety.com/products/flock-aerodome-drone-as-automated-security
Cam: A drone in a dock for private sites. Every alert gets an immediate aerial view, at roughly the cost of a single guard.
<<jump hub>>
===
title: products_platform
---
// src: https://www.flocksafety.com/products/flock-safety-platform
Cam: Unify your safety tools in one connected system — 4,800+ agencies, live in 49 states, with over a million cases supported in 2025.
// src: https://www.flocksafety.com/products (National LPR Network, folded in)
Cam: The platform also carries the National LPR Network, the largest agency-controlled LPR network in the country. #newmessage
<<jump hub>>
===
title: products_os
---
// src: https://www.flocksafety.com/products/flock-os
Cam: FlockOS connects your devices, data, and departments in one secure RTCC-like hub — 4,800+ connected agencies and 5,000+ neighborhoods and businesses, 24/7.
<<jump hub>>
===
title: products_911
---
// src: https://www.flocksafety.com/products/flock911
Cam: Flock911 streams live 911 calls and transcripts en route and shows calls across jurisdictions, so responders can bypass dispatch delays.
<<jump hub>>
